  "HERBST-SPECIAL · 🎃 HALLOWEEN":["SPÉCIAL AUTOMNE · 🎃 HALLOWEEN","SPECIALE AUTUNNO · 🎃 HALLOWEEN","AUTUMN SPECIAL · 🎃 HALLOWEEN"],
  "Entdecke besondere Fundstücke aus deiner Nähe, verkaufe oder verschenke in wenigen Schritten – lokal, direkt und ohne Gruselpreise.":["Découvrez des trouvailles uniques près de chez vous, vendez ou donnez en quelques étapes – local, direct et sans prix effrayants.","Scopri oggetti speciali vicino a te, vendi o regala in pochi passaggi – locale, diretto e senza prezzi da paura.","Discover special finds near you, sell or give away in just a few steps – local, direct and without scary prices."],
